   By B2 (Jacobi cube identity) `(qPoch)^3 = ∑ (-1)^k (2k+1) X^{T_k}`.
   `T_k mod 11 ∈ {0, 1, 3, 6, 10}` after excluding `k ≡ 5 mod 11` (where the
   coefficient `2k+1 ≡ 0 mod 11`).
