   only terms with exponent `≡ i (mod 11)`.

2. Frobenius lift: `1/(qPoch ZMod 11) = (qPoch)^{21}/(qPoch)^{22}`.
   `(qPoch)^{22} = ((qPoch)^{11})^2 = (expand 11 qPoch)^2` (Frobenius).
   `(qPoch)^{21} = ((qPoch)^3)^7 = (J_0+J_1+J_3+J_6+J_{10})^7`.
